<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -- Redwood Trust.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -- Redwood Trust.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it raised its 1997 earnings estimates on Redwood Trust Inc to $2.52 a share from $2.05 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $3.80 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $95 a share.</p>
<p>-- Redwood Trust gained 2-9/16 to to 54-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
